  <section class="sub">
    <div class="sub__head">
      <span class="sub__no">2.3</span>
      <h2>A failure is not yet an explanation</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="sub__body">
      <p>
        Statistics can tell you that something is wrong. It cannot tell you why. That is the work of
        failure analysis and corrective action (FACA).
      </p>
      <p>
        Root cause is the chain of conditions that made the failure possible. The failed component
        may be the endpoint, not the origin. Design, process, material, firmware and use environment
        can all belong to the same mechanism.
      </p>
      <p>
        A corrective action matters only when it breaks that chain. Revalidation proves whether it did.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>
          Confidence is not a stack of passes. It is an explanation that chartives scale.
        </strong>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Essay>

